# clamber-scenario v1
#
# A whole run through the first level, from the start to the goal,
# without losing a life, on the default preset. The playthrough test
# (crates/sim/tests/playthrough.rs) plays it so CI proves the level stays
# completable. If a change to the level or to movement breaks it, find a
# new run with crates/sim/examples/find_run.rs.
id: first-level
summary: Play the first level from the start to the goal
requires: content/base/levels/first.level
start: the level's start, lead character, default preset
frames: 3162

